const VOX37 = {"Leave the kettle. It's hot. It's always hot.":"v37_4bba45fe","Take what's yours. Nothing in there is mine.":"v37_77efdcc4","It takes nothing and gives you water. Don't ask it for more.":"v37_891500d9","Camera. Swim up. Not across.":"v37_1ac5490e","Good. Take your shoes off.":"v37_e566aac6","Don't drip on the cot.":"v37_2ed0e823","Towels are on the rack. The blue ones are clean.":"v37_10110401","Camera, right? I know the harness. You're the third I've seen come through that door.":"v37_46df0ab3","Abara. Relief team. Nobody has been relieved.":"v37_f8e19212","Don't drink it. Sit in it all you like. That's the trouble.":"v37_7b680dca","Three weeks by my watch. My watch says three hours. I don't trust either number.":"v37_86c576d4","Kowalczyk went up the stairs in the blue house and the stairs weren't there. Lund went after him. I stayed with the radio.":"v37_85275d80","The radio was a pool. I won't explain that any better.":"v37_07f2fb78","There was a Camera before you. Pell. Tall. Hummed when he was thinking.":"v37_1dd4736e","He left his camcorder in the pit and my cassette went in after it. I was cleaning it. I'd like tape four back.":"v37_f0c0a828","Plant's through the west door. Key's under the kettle. I'd go, but somebody has to be here when it boils.":"v37_d009e8fa","Kettle. Under it. It isn't a riddle.":"v37_0500423f","West door, then. The wheel marked SHALLOWS. Hold it.":"v37_9e1ed605","Gate three. Let it run down and walk to the bottom. Don't dive for it. It's one tape.":"v37_15dca73f","The pit. South end. Mind the step.":"v37_a5492255","That's four. That's definitely four.":"v37_57e3eb9c","He had a tape in there too? Put it on the table. I'll listen later. Not now.":"v37_864be269","Right. Three doors, none of them out.":"v37_3ce60484","Pit corridor, south: a hotel. Down the well and along: a hospital. East end of the lane pool: a park.":"v37_90ea5ce6","Each one keeps one thing. Nobody gives it up for free.":"v37_a80d36c5","The lifeguard's panel has three slots. I count them every morning.":"v37_3f59baf2","Hotel. Did the music follow you? It follows me.":"v37_df974cd2","You drank from the tanks? Nobody drinks from the tanks.":"v37_f237f45f","I did once. Very good. I don't remember the afternoon.":"v37_dc831bdc","There's a second cot. I'm not saying anything. It's there.":"v37_f21650ec","You'll go up. I know. Leave the kettle on. I'll hear it from here.":"v37_c8599493","Go on. Tell somebody the water was warm.":"v37_ef7731c9","Drink something. You look like a drowned tape.":"v37_930d36c5","The pumps are complaining. Let them.":"v37_70e65706","The booth is on the north side of the deep end. The door sticks.":"v37_eccb3d6b","Blue towels are the clean ones. I did say.":"v37_09ee52f9","Was there a roster? Kowalczyk and Lund would be on it.":"v37_474e420a","Don't tell me which ward.":"v37_20982bb7","Anyone of yours on there? Don't answer that either.":"v37_ebbcb28c","Nine. Camera, there is water on your carrier. A lot of it.":"v37_e01fdd2c","Nine. Find a floor that isn't wet and stand on it.":"v37_729117b1","Nine. Your carrier just cleared. First time all hour.":"v37_0d7acbdf","Nine. Somebody just told you not to drip on a cot. That was not one of ours.":"v37_edcdccc0","Nine. Whatever you just did, my board says the level is about to move. Keep your head up.":"v37_d7ecbb38","Nine. You've been in the water a while. Pick a door.":"v37_2034b7dc","Nine. Three doors and you've used none. Not complaining.":"v37_75055a73","Nine. You're on a camera feed we don't have. Somebody is watching it with you.":"v37_2ec60372","Nine. Your carrier dropped for a while. Keep moving.":"v37_9dcd86c8","Hale. Nine says you're in water. Don't float. Keep walking, keep counting.":"v37_6b32cbc6","The Deep is now open.":"v37_84ad7442","Please keep your arms and legs inside the water.":"v37_fa55f338","The Deep is open. The Deep is open.":"v37_e2ad6fc5","Lost belongings may be collected at the surface.":"v37_cc4d31b5","Now serving number zero.":"v37_e3410c95","Visiting hours are over. Visiting hours are over.":"v37_0b3a4e88","Bed three, your linen is on its way.":"v37_2442268f","Would the owner of a cream Hi-8 please return to Admissions.":"v37_6d054aee","Please keep your voices down. Patients are resting.":"v37_a6b5373e","Doctor to Records. Doctor to Records.":"v37_5d610b4d","Power has been restored to the staff areas.":"v37_76ac947a","The wave pool is now open.":"v37_0693733a","Water World is now closed. Please make your way to the nearest exit. The nearest exit is behind you.":"v37_a4372309","Please remember to take your belongings with you.":"v37_fa33f5fa","Lost children will be taken to the front gate. There are no lost children.":"v37_b3fd5aa0","The Deep is closed due to weather.":"v37_bf7d5a26","Please do not tap on the glass.":"v37_7a3d98bf","Thank you for visiting Water World.":"v37_625acbe3","Go on. I've got forty more.":"v37_f6d16ac3","Lane four is yours if you want it. Nobody swims it.":"v37_675f0fbb","I'm not going anywhere. Another forty.":"v37_f98b3cc7","Not yet. Forty lengths.":"v37_af8a618d","Sorry. I'm counting, and somebody is counting with me, and he's a stroke ahead.":"v37_bd83b143","Room 204. There's a stopwatch on the nightstand.":"v37_7bcbfe6e","I can't start without it. It's silly. It's a stopwatch.":"v37_a4e8f8ce","That's his. It's dented where he dropped it at Regionals.":"v37_ec0aa399","Press the top when I touch the wall. Not before. Not after.":"v37_19b5d648","Press the top when I touch the wall.":"v37_5780fdf7","Room 204. Nightstand.":"v37_6b77a1bb","Slow.":"v37_be436630","He'd have said slow.":"v37_19dd71b3","He would have been wrong. But he'd have said it.":"v37_30d10815","Reception. There's a door beside the escalator that isn't a door. Here.":"v37_490d5dd0","Don't read the card. I always read the card.":"v37_eb86cde5","Go.":"v37_76541770","Discharged.":"v37_2a26743f","Leave the way you came. Mind the wet floor.":"v37_3974310b","Thank you.":"v37_4582c0f0","Cold in here?":"v37_999a481c","Drip. Good.":"v37_56cbca59","Chart. Then form. Then stamp.":"v37_a30d4a4e","Pending. They're always pending at first.":"v37_a15707d2","Lanyard. For the pharmacy.":"v37_799b61de","…checkout was at eleven…":"v37_f60e8bd1","…ask at reception…":"v37_f05e384f","…you shouldn't…":"v37_b4274b99","Name? ...Camera. Surname Camera. Take a seat.":"v37_a803443f","Your number is one. We are on zero.":"v37_a9e626f4","Ward three has been waiting since breakfast. Linen's on the shelf. Don't count it, it moves.":"v37_0affe9e7","Pharmacy is locked. The lanyard is on the one in the hall. Not me.":"v37_2aa0090c","Chart, form, stamp. In that order.":"v37_6dd07823","Everyone's in here. Look under your own letter if you like. Most do. Nobody finds it.":"v37_e84bac6d","Shh.":"v37_46833f66","Drip.":"v37_e83078ae","Excuse me.":"v37_3047ebd6","Mind the bed.":"v37_17ba81f8","Not today.":"v37_5b09eda4","…you can put it down for a minute…":"v37_3895b83a","…the water is the same temperature as you…":"v37_51361e9c","…count the tiles, it helps…":"v37_69296e2c","…your tea's gone cold…":"v37_97f9bd71","…you were going somewhere…":"v37_cdb020c1","…it's only water…":"v37_973fb2e9"};
